---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Cta from '../../components/Cta.astro';
const pageSlug = 'features-offline';
const articleLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Article',
  headline: 'Offline and local-only Android vault',
  description: 'Vireault stores encrypted photos and files on your phone with no account and no cloud vault server.',
  author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Vireault' },
  datePublished: '2026-11-05',
  dateModified: '2026-11-05',
  mainEntityOfPage: 'https://vireault.app/features/offline',
};
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Offline and local-only vault"
  description="Vireault is offline and local only: no account, no cloud vault, encryption keys stay on your Android device."
  path="/features/offline"
  pageSlug={pageSlug}
  ogType="article"
  jsonLd={articleLd}
  article={{ published: '2026-11-05', modified: '2026-11-05' }}
>
  <div class="container">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }, { href: '/features', label: 'Features' }, { label: 'Offline' }]} />
    <article class="section prose">
      <h1>Offline and local only</h1>
      <p>Some vault apps pair convenience with accounts and sync. Vireault takes the opposite default: your encrypted library stays on the phone you hold.</p>
      <h2>No account</h2>
      <p>There is no email signup and no phone-number login. You create a vault, choose an unlock method, and start importing.</p>
      <h2>No cloud vault server</h2>
      <p>We do not host your photos or files. If you want a copy elsewhere, you export an <a href="/features/backup-restore">encrypted backup file</a> and store it where you choose.</p>
      <Cta pageSlug={pageSlug} heading="Use a vault that works without an account" />
      <h2>Trade-offs we will not hide</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Losing the device without a backup can mean losing access to the vault data</li>
        <li>Cloud sync is not built in</li>
        <li>We cannot reset a forgotten PIN, pattern or passphrase</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Those trade-offs are the point of a local-first design. Compare approaches in <a href="/compare/keepsafe">Vireault vs Keepsafe</a>, the <a href="/guides/keepsafe-alternative-android-no-account">Keepsafe alternative without an account</a> guide, and <a href="/guides/secure-photo-vault-android">secure photo vault for Android</a>.</p>
    </article>
    <Cta pageSlug={pageSlug} />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
